# 詞: 睇怕

1. 佢見到佢女朋友同另一個人講嘢，即刻睇怕，覺得自己被背叛。 (He felt jealous immediately when he saw his girlfriend talking to someone else, feeling betrayed.)
2. 佢見到佢兄弟買咗新車，心裡睇怕，自己都想買一台。 (He felt jealous when he saw his brother buy a new car, wanting one for himself too.)
3. 佢同事喺公司獲得咗升職加薪，佢心裡睇怕，覺得自己唔公平。 (He felt jealous when his colleague got a promotion and raise, feeling it was unfair.)
4. 佢見到佢好友同靚女仔出嚟，心裡睇怕，自己都想有個女朋友。 (He felt jealous when he saw his friend going out with a beautiful girl, wanting a girlfriend too.)
5. 佢兄弟喺學校得咗高分，佢心裡睇怕，自己學習唔夠努力。 (He felt jealous when his brother got high scores at school, feeling he didn't study hard enough.)
6. 佢見到佢鄰居屋企翻新咗，心裡睇怕，自己屋企都想翻新。 (He felt jealous when he saw his neighbor renovate their house, wanting to renovate his own too.)
7. 佢女朋友同其他男人講嘢，佢即刻睇怕，覺得自己唔好。 (He felt jealous immediately when his girlfriend talked to other men, feeling inadequate.)
8. 佢同事喺公司獲得咗表揚，佢心裡睇怕，自己都想獲得認可。 (He felt jealous when his colleague received recognition at work, wanting recognition too.)
9. 佢見到佢好友買咗名牌包，心裡睇怕，自己都想買一個。 (He felt jealous when he saw his friend buy a designer bag, wanting one too.)
10. 佢兄弟喺比賽得咗第一，佢心裡睇怕，自己都想參加比賽。 (He felt jealous when his brother won first place in a competition, wanting to participate too.) [end of text]


